WEBVTT

NOTE Narration is displayed in the caption strip below the video by default.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.326
Three explanations could lead to the same repeated question.

00:00:04.326 --> 00:00:08.652
If information is hard to find, improve the reference.

00:00:08.652 --> 00:00:11.055
If policies disagree, reconcile them.

00:00:11.055 --> 00:00:15.380
If requests go to the wrong team, review routing.

00:00:15.380 --> 00:00:19.226
We have not established which cause is correct.

00:00:19.226 --> 00:00:24.032
AI is helping us compare possibilities, not delivering a verdict.
